      "writtenOn": "2024-10-29T17:39:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`rv` is derived from external sources. I don\u0027t think we should assert on it.\n\nIf we can\u0027t produce a valid request message, we should Hard Reset. That being said, if we\u0027re running this code, that would suggest that the PDC already produced some Request message. So if we can\u0027t pick a PDO, you\u0027re probably right that it\u0027s a programming error, but I don\u0027t think it ought to be a fatal one.\n\nAs an aside, if you wanted to retain this assert behavior, I think you would need different tests than we have now to verify it.",
      "revId": "a4221a059af5cf0d6696e74988a6baaa06d505dc",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
